# Keep Docker/ACR build contexts small and free of local state.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
.github
.codex
.claude
.vscode
.idea
# The image ships docs/help (GET /api/help/articles); the rest is contributor docs.
docs/*
!docs/help
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__tests__
backend/claude-raw-stream.log
